mMargin>0.03</BottomMargin><VerticalAlign>1</VerticalAlign></TextBlock><Char IX="0"><Font>0</Font><Color>#172B48</Color><Size>0.117</Size><Style>1</Style></Char><Para IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>Entra 受控身分</Text><Geom IX="0"><MoveTo IX="1"><X>0</X><Y>0</Y></MoveTo><LineTo IX="2"><X>1.09</X><Y>0</Y></LineTo><LineTo IX="3"><X>1.09</X><Y>0.33</Y></LineTo><LineTo IX="4"><X>0</X><Y>0.33</Y></LineTo><LineTo IX="5"><X>0</X><Y>0</Y></LineTo></Geom></Shape><Shape ID="72" NameU="Entra managed identities responsibility" Type="Shape"><XForm><PinX>17.415</PinX><PinY>2.65</PinY><Width>1.09</Width><Height>0.38</Height><LocPinX>0.545</LocPinX><LocPinY>0.19</LocPinY></XForm><Line><LineWeight>0.015</LineWeight><LineColor>#CCD8E6</LineColor><LinePattern>0</LinePattern></Line><Fill><FillForegnd>#FFFFFF</FillForegnd><FillPattern>0</FillPattern></Fill><TextBlock><LeftMargin>0.07</LeftMargin><RightMargin>0.07</RightMargin><TopMargin>0.03</TopMargin><BottomMargin>0.03</BottomMargin><VerticalAlign>1</VerticalAlign></TextBlock><Char IX="0"><Font>0</Font><Color>#526783</Color><Size>0.102</Size><Style>0</Style></Char><Para IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>讓服務安全存取 Azure 資源</Text><Geom IX="0"><MoveTo IX="1"><X>0</X><Y>0</Y></MoveTo><LineTo IX="2"><X>1.09</X><Y>0</Y></LineTo><LineTo IX="3"><X>1.09</X><Y>0.38</Y></LineTo><LineTo IX="4"><X>0</X><Y>0.38</Y></LineTo><LineTo IX="5"><X>0</X><Y>0</Y></LineTo></Geom></Shape><Shape ID="73" NameU="Shared interactions" Type="Shape"><XForm><PinX>9.48</PinX><PinY>1.905</PinY><Width>17.1</Width><Height>0.47</Height><LocPinX>8.55</LocPinX><LocPinY>0.235</LocPinY></XForm><Line><LineWeight>0.015</LineWeight><LineColor>#CCD8E6</LineColor><LinePattern>0</LinePattern></Line><Fill><FillForegnd>#FFFFFF</FillForegnd><FillPattern>0</FillPattern></Fill><TextBlock><LeftMargin>0.07</LeftMargin><RightMargin>0.07</RightMargin><TopMargin>0.03</TopMargin><BottomMargin>0.03</BottomMargin><VerticalAlign>1</VerticalAlign></TextBlock><Char IX="0"><Font>0</Font><Color>#526783</Color><Size>0.125</Size><Style>0</Style></Char><Para IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>管理後端與背景程式會讀寫 PostgreSQL；APIM 從 Table Storage 查預算；Key Vault 與 Entra 提供安全存取；監控服務協助發現問題。</Text><Geom IX="0"><MoveTo IX="1"><X>0</X><Y>0</Y></MoveTo><LineTo IX="2"><X>17.1</X><Y>0</Y></LineTo><LineTo IX="3"><X>17.1</X><Y>0.47</Y></LineTo><LineTo IX="4"><X>0</X><Y>0.47</Y></LineTo><LineTo IX="5"><X>0</X><Y>0</Y></LineTo></Geom></Shape><Shape ID="74" NameU="Scope note" Type="Shape"><XForm><PinX>9.53</PinX><PinY>1.285</PinY><Width>17.2</Width><Height>0.47</Height><LocPinX>8.6</LocPinX><LocPinY>0.235</LocPinY></XForm><Line><LineWeight>0.015</LineWeight><LineColor>#CCD8E6</LineColor><LinePattern>0</LinePattern></Line><Fill><FillForegnd>#FFFFFF</FillForegnd><FillPattern>0</FillPattern></Fill><TextBlock><LeftMargin>0.07</LeftMargin><RightMargin>0.07</RightMargin><TopMargin>0.03</TopMargin><BottomMargin>0.03</BottomMargin><VerticalAlign>1</VerticalAlign></TextBlock><Char IX="0"><Font>0</Font><Color>#526783</Color><Size>0.116</Size><Style>0</Style></Char><Para IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>注意：Turnstile 不會建立客戶自己的 Foundry 專案或模型。虛線表示不是每一個請求都會走的特殊流程。</Text><Geom IX="0"><MoveTo IX="1"><X>0</X><Y>0</Y></MoveTo><LineTo IX="2"><X>17.2</X><Y>0</Y></LineTo><LineTo IX="3"><X>17.2</X><Y>0.47</Y></LineTo><LineTo IX="4"><X>0</X><Y>0.47</Y></LineTo><LineTo IX="5"><X>0</X><Y>0</Y></LineTo></Geom></Shape><Shape ID="75" NameU="Legend" Type="Shape"><XForm><PinX>9.53</PinX><PinY>0.405</PinY><Width>17.8</Width><Height>0.29</Height><LocPinX>8.9</LocPinX><LocPinY>0.145</LocPinY></XForm><Line><LineWeight>0.015</LineWeight><LineColor>#CCD8E6</LineColor><LinePattern>0</LinePattern></Line><Fill><FillForegnd>#FFFFFF</FillForegnd><FillPattern>0</FillPattern></Fill><TextBlock><LeftMargin>0.07</LeftMargin><RightMargin>0.07</RightMargin><TopMargin>0.03</TopMargin><BottomMargin>0.03</BottomMargin><VerticalAlign>1</VerticalAlign></TextBlock><Char IX="0"><Font>0</Font><Color>#526783</Color><Size>0.108</Size><Style>0</Style></Char><Para IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>藍色＝呼叫模型前的檢查     綠色＝記錄用量     紫色＝管理設定     橘色＝套用新設定     實線＝每次都走的流程     虛線＝特殊情況</Text><Geom IX="0"><MoveTo IX="1"><X>0</X><Y>0</Y></MoveTo><LineTo IX="2"><X>17.8</X><Y>0</Y></LineTo><LineTo IX="3"><X>17.8</X><Y>0.29</Y></LineTo><LineTo IX="4"><X>0</X><Y>0.29</Y></LineTo><LineTo IX="5"><X>0</X><Y>0</Y></LineTo></Geom></Shape></Shapes></Page></Pages></VisioDocument>
